jev-shorts-editor

This project includes sound effect files from HyperFrames
(https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0:

  assets/sfx/whoosh.mp3
  assets/sfx/pop.mp3
  assets/sfx/chime.mp3
  assets/sfx/riser.mp3
  assets/sfx/impact-bass-1.mp3

A copy of the Apache License 2.0 is in assets/sfx/LICENSE-HYPERFRAMES.

This project vendors the 24fps editor engine from https://24fps.dev/video-editor
(https://24fps.dev/editor/engine.js, v0.4.0), licensed under the MIT License as
stated in the file header:

  src/short/film/vendor/engine.js

It also vendors preset JSON from the 24fps video-editor library (credit:
24fps.dev/video-editor) in src/short/film/presets24/, recorded one by one in
src/short/film/presets24/manifest.json, and latin-subset woff2 files of Google
Fonts families (SIL Open Font License or Apache License 2.0, per family) in
src/short/film/vendor/fonts/ so that nothing is fetched at render time. The
preset API returns no per-preset author or license field.
